        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRPRT, Circulaire Rose with Portofino Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Portofino Lever with Circulaire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from several beautiful finishes. The Circulaire Rose with Portofino Lever is simple, yet stunning. Its captivating style makes it a favorite among designers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRPRT Circulaire Rosette with Portofino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Circulaire Collection Portofino Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRPRT-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262386\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIRPRT Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
