                "title": "Portofino Lever with Circulaire Rose",
                "description": "The Portofino Lever with Circulaire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from several beautiful finishes. The Circulaire Rose with Portofino Lever is simple, yet stunning. Its captivating style makes it a favorite among designers.",
